        explanation: "We know that a³ - b³ = (a - b)(a² + ab + b²) = (a - b)((a - b)² + 3ab).<br>Substitute values: 56 = 2 × (2² + 3ab) => 28 = 4 + 3ab => 3ab = 24 => ab = 8.<br>Now, a² + b² = (a - b)² + 2ab = 2² + 2 × 8 = 4 + 16 = 20.",
